		<li>MBA, Strategy &amp; Marketing | Indian Institute of Management Indore | 2020</li>
		<li>Exchange Programme, Tech &amp; Management Studies | NEOMA Business School, France | 2019</li>
		<li>B.Tech, Electronics &amp; Telecommunications | College of Engineering Pune (COEP) | 2017</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Skills</h2>
	<p>
		Product strategy, 0→1 product development, product discovery, product sense, design sense, growth
		and conversion, retention, search and recommendations, AI/ML products, LLMs and AI agents,
		LangChain products, AI evaluation, SQL, Python, experimentation and analytics, Mixpanel, CleverTap,
		rapid prototyping.
	</p>

